[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24061.468, "timestamp": "06:41:01", "text": "黑名单"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24065.11, "timestamp": "06:41:05", "text": "对于无法直播的游戏类型"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24067.75, "timestamp": "06:41:07", "text": "那个东西。所以，是的，我必须……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24070.628, "timestamp": "06:41:10", "text": "实际上，在这方面要格外小心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24079.11, "timestamp": "06:41:19", "text": "东西。为什么翻译是“straya”？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24085.23, "timestamp": "06:41:25", "text": "什么？什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24087.628, "timestamp": "06:41:27", "text": "嗯？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24089.31, "timestamp": "06:41:29", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24093.868, "timestamp": "06:41:33", "text": "Nano，你为什么喜欢这个？你为什么要这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24099.35, "timestamp": "06:41:39", "text": "翻译？好的。哦，是的。我们呃，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24101.75, "timestamp": "06:41:41", "text": "现在还有1小时30分钟。我们还没有测试过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24105.27, "timestamp": "06:41:45", "text": "比蹦床之类的东西强多了。嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24107.99, "timestamp": "06:41:47", "text": "我们稍后会看一下。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24110.548, "timestamp": "06:41:50", "text": "所以今天的直播我想做点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24113.59, "timestamp": "06:41:53", "text": "只是闲聊，主要是看看我是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24116.628, "timestamp": "06:41:56", "text": "如果我能够发起小的……可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24119.27, "timestamp": "06:41:59", "text": "继续交谈"}]